&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1j4zddb&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;Who we are:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Geotab ® is a global leader in IoT and connected transportation and certified “Great Place to Work™.” We are a company of diverse and talented individuals who work together to help businesses grow and succeed, and increase the safety and sustainability of our communities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Geotab is advancing security, connecting commercial vehicles to the internet and providing web-based analytics to help customers better manage their fleets. Geotab’s open platform and Geotab Marketplace ®, offering hundreds of third-party solution options, allows both small and large businesses to automate operations by integrating vehicle data with their other data assets. Processing billions of data points a day, Geotab leverages data analytics and machine learning to improve productivity, optimize fleets through the reduction of fuel consumption, enhance driver safety and achieve strong compliance to regulatory changes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Our team is growing and we’re looking for people who follow their passion, think differently and want to make an impact. Ours is a fast paced, ever changing environment. Geotabbers accept that challenge and are willing to take on new tasks and activities - ones that may not always be described in the initial job description. Join us for a fulfilling career with opportunities to innovate, great benefits, and our fun and inclusive work culture. Reach your full potential with Geotab. To see what it’s like to be a Geotabber, check out our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineHover css-sbvzk&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.geotab.com/blog/&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and follow us @InsideGeotab on&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineHover css-sbvzk&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidegeotab/&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;Who you are:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are always looking for amazing talent who can contribute to our growth and deliver results! Geotab is seeking a&lt;strong&gt; Lead Global Partner Program Manager&lt;/strong&gt; who will lead translating the Global Partner Program strategy, into operational programs that achieve measurable partner and business outcomes If you love technology, and are keen to join an industry leader — we would love to hear from you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Lead Global Partner Program Manager&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;nbsp;your key area of responsibility will be to translate the Global Partner Program strategy, into operational programs that achieve measurable partner and business outcomes. This Lead Global Program Manager is a hands-on executor who will build, run, and continuously enhance the partner program&#39;s operational backbone. The role involves close coordination with Program Leads in GTM, Referral, Partner Onboarding, and Partner Enablement to ensure execution is consistent, scalable, and aligned with leadership&#39;s direction. The ideal candidate is a structured builder and operator who excels at execution, possesses strong commercial and partner program management discipline, and can drive results across a cross-functional partner ecosystem. The role is operational in nature, focused on program execution and delivery rather than partner strategy or partner relationship management.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;How you&#39;ll make an impact:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;Design and operationalize partner program frameworks, governance standards, and partner lifecycle processes that scale across a global, multi-motion partner ecosystem&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;Translate program strategy into structured execution plans, operational calendars, and delivery frameworks across multiple partner program pillars&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;Own the day-to-day operational health of the partner program — program compliance, partner communications, process documentation, and governance execution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;Maintain and evolve partner-facing program guidelines, tier criteria, and operational standards as living assets that reflect current program state&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;Directly produce program outputs — playbooks, frameworks, governance documents, and process standards — as a hands-on executor who builds, not just plans&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;Define and maintain the partner health reporting framework, tracking ecosystem KPIs including partner activation, tier distribution, performance trends, and program compliance across the partner base&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;Build reporting models that surface actionable insights for leadership — translating partner program data into clear analysis of what is driving ecosystem performance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;Proactively identify operational gaps and program inefficiencies, and bring forward structured recommendations and solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;Serve as the operational backbone across multiple partner program workstreams, ensuring consistent execution standards, connected processes, and shared operational context across program leads&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;Identify and resolve dependencies, sequencing conflicts, and execution gaps across program pillars before they impact delivery&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;Maintain the master program roadmap and operational calendar, coordinating delivery milestones across all workstreams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;Partner with internal stakeholders to ensure partner program execution is aligned with commercial objectives and go-to-market priorities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;Collaborate with systems and technology teams to ensure partner-facing platforms and tools accurately reflect program requirements and support partner and internal user needs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;Serve as the operational subject matter expert on partner program structure, governance, and requirements for internal teams and leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;Drive ongoing communication to revenue-facing teams on partner program positioning, offerings, and joint value propositions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll bring to the role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(126, 140, 141); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;10-12+ years of experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;Experience with hyperscale partner programs (AWS Partner Network, Microsoft GPS, Google Cloud Partner Program, Salesforce AppExchange ecosystem) strongly preferred&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;Direct experience working within a partner program, alliance program, or channel program at a technology company — not general program management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;Experience building and maintaining partner program operational frameworks, governance processes, or partner lifecycle workflows&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;Familiarity with how indirect channel programs are structured: tier systems, scoring models, MDF, deal registration, partner performance metrics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;Demonstrated track record of executing and delivering impactful programs and tiered partner models — a doer who produces results, not just plans&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;Strong operational and program management skills with the ability to manage multiple workstreams simultaneously and maintain quality across all of them&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;Experienced working within strategy set by leadership and translating direction into structured, executable programs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;Embraces AI and builds workflows, reporting frameworks, and operational models that scale outcomes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;Commercial acumen with experience contributing to partner revenue and growth targets through operational program levers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;Technical fluency of AI platforms and demonstrated practical usage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication — able to produce clean process documentation, program collateral, and crisp executive-ready updates&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;Collaborative and effective working alongside peer Program Leads without direct authority&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(126, 140, 141);&quot;&gt;Telematics experience a bonus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;If you got this far, we hope you&#39;re feeling excited about this role! Even if you don&#39;t feel you meet every single requirement, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1spul5l&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note: Geotab does not accept agency resumes and is not responsible for any fees related to unsolicited resumes. Please do not forward resumes to Geotab employees.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1spul5l&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1spul5l&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This posting is for an existing vacancy.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1spul5l&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h1 class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1spul5l&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;Why job seekers choose Geotab:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1spul5l&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1spul5l&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Flex working arrangements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Home office reimbursement program&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Baby bonus &amp;amp; parental leave top up program&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Online learning and networking opportunities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Electric vehicle purchase incentive program&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Competitive medical and dental benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Retirement savings program&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;*The above are offered to full-time permanent employees only&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1spul5l&quot;&gt;
&lt;h1 class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1j4zddb&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;How we work:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;At Geotab, we have adopted a&amp;nbsp;flexible hybrid&amp;nbsp;working model in that we have systems, functions, programs and policies in place to support both in-person and virtual work. However, you are welcomed and encouraged to come into our beautiful, safe, clean offices as often as you like. When working from home, you are required to have a reliable internet connection with at least 50mb DL/10mb UL. Virtual work is supported with cloud-based applications, collaboration tools and asynchronous working. The health and safety of employees are a top priority. We encourage work-life balance and keep the Geotab culture going strong with online social events, chat rooms and gatherings. Join us and help reshape the future of technology!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140); font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;We believe that ensuring diversity is fundamental to our future growth and progress and is an integral part of our business. We believe that success happens where new ideas can flourish – in an environment that is rich in diversity and a place where people from various backgrounds can work together. Geotab encourages applications from all qualified individuals. We are committed to accommodating people with disabilities during the recruitment and assessment processes and when people are hired. We will ensure the accessibility needs of employees with disabilities are taken into account as part of performance management, career development, training and redeployment processes. If you require accommodation at any stage of the application process or want more information about our diversity and inclusion as well as accommodation policies and practices, please contact us at careers@geotab.com. By submitting a job application to Geotab Inc. or its affiliates and subsidiaries (collectively, “Geotab”), you acknowledge Geotab’s collection, use and disclosure of your personal data in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.geotab.com/privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. Click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1uE3uV2SSp0YnYx4utU9QdhN8Q_RzqMphI_pVJyVWQn8/edit?tab=t.0&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to read our Privacy Notice.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The annual base salary for this position is the expected annual salary for this role, and may be subject to change. Geotab offers various perks and benefits and other compensation components that an individual may be eligible for. The actual base salary for this position depends on a variety of factors such as but not limited to skills, qualifications, education and overall experience, including the location the applicant lives while performing the job. This also includes equity with other team members and alignment with local market data. All offers of employment are contingent upon proof of eligibility to work and the individual&#39;s ability to pass a background check.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Hiring Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$130,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$155,000 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
